{
  "source_dashboard": "lovelace.meu_dashboard",
  "url_path": "meu-dashboard",
  "view": {
    "title": "LED Matrix",
    "path": "ledmatrix",
    "icon": "mdi:led-strip-variant",
    "type": "sections",
    "max_columns": 2,
    "background": {
      "opacity": 15,
      "alignment": "center",
      "size": "cover",
      "repeat": "no-repeat",
      "attachment": "fixed"
    },
    "header": {
      "card": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "text_only": true,
        "content": "# 🐱 LED Matrix **{{ now().strftime('%H:%M') }}**\nControle rapido do badge ESP32-S3 8x8."
      },
      "layout": "center",
      "badges_position": "bottom",
      "badges_wrap": "wrap"
    },
    "badges": [
      {
        "type": "entity",
        "entity": "input_text.ledmatrix8x8_message",
        "show_icon": true,
        "show_state": true,
        "show_name": false
      },
      {
        "type": "entity",
        "entity": "input_text.ledmatrix8x8_color",
        "show_icon": true,
        "show_state": true,
        "show_name": false
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "type": "grid",
        "cards": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "heading": "Controle",
            "heading_style": "subtitle",
            "icon": "mdi:remote"
          },
          {
            "type": "entities",
            "title": "Mensagem ao vivo",
            "show_header_toggle": false,
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": "full",
              "rows": 5
            },
            "entities": [
              {
                "entity": "input_text.ledmatrix8x8_message",
                "name": "Mensagem"
              },
              {
                "entity": "input_text.ledmatrix8x8_color",
                "name": "Cor (r,g,b ou #RRGGBB)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": "full",
              "rows": 3
            },
            "content": "O firmware consulta estes helpers a cada **5 segundos**. Mensagem vazia devolve o display para o playback do `config.yaml`. Use `ICON:nome:mensagem` para mostrar um icone 8x8 antes do texto (`agenda`, `task`, `status`, `focus`, `call`, `break`, `error`). Cor vazia usa a cor HA padrao."
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "name": "Limpar / voltar ao config",
            "icon": "mdi:eraser",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_clear"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 6,
              "rows": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "name": "Cor padrao HA",
            "icon": "mdi:palette-swatch",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "input_text.set_value",
              "target": {
                "entity_id": "input_text.ledmatrix8x8_color"
              },
              "data": {
                "value": "0,255,160"
              }
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 6,
              "rows": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "grid",
        "cards": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "heading": "Presets rápidos",
            "heading_style": "subtitle",
            "icon": "mdi:cat"
          },
          {
            "show_name": true,
            "show_icon": true,
            "type": "button",
            "name": "FOCO",
            "icon": "mdi:target",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_foco"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 4,
              "rows": 2
            },
            "entity": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_foco"
          },
          {
            "show_name": true,
            "show_icon": true,
            "type": "button",
            "name": "CALL",
            "icon": "mdi:phone-in-talk",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_call"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 4,
              "rows": 2
            },
            "entity": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_call"
          },
          {
            "show_name": true,
            "show_icon": true,
            "type": "button",
            "name": "DONE",
            "icon": "mdi:check-circle",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_done"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 4,
              "rows": 2
            },
            "entity": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_done"
          },
          {
            "show_name": true,
            "show_icon": true,
            "type": "button",
            "name": "BREAK",
            "icon": "mdi:coffee",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_break"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 4,
              "rows": 2
            },
            "entity": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_break"
          },
          {
            "show_name": true,
            "show_icon": true,
            "type": "button",
            "name": "ERROR",
            "icon": "mdi:alert-circle",
            "show_state": false,
            "tap_action": {
              "action": "call-service",
              "service": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_error"
            },
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": 4,
              "rows": 2
            },
            "entity": "script.ledmatrix8x8_preset_error"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "grid",
        "cards": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "heading": "Diagnóstico",
            "heading_style": "subtitle",
            "icon": "mdi:chip"
          },
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "grid_options": {
              "columns": "full",
              "rows": 4
            },
            "content": "**ESP32-S3**: `192.168.15.50`\n**Helpers**: `input_text.ledmatrix8x8_message` e `input_text.ledmatrix8x8_color`\n**Prioridade do firmware**: Serial > Home Assistant > `config.yaml`."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
